{"id":"chtoby","lemma":"чтобы","pos":"conj","rank":27,"glosses":["that...should (indicates the subjunctive)","so that, in order that; in order to","lest"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/91/Ru-%D1%87%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%8B.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%8B.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты здесь, чтобы помочь мне?","en":"Are you here to help me?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"to help"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Вы пришли, чтобы спасти меня?","en":"Have you come to save me?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"},null,{"g":"to save, to rescue"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Что они хотят, чтобы ты сделал?","en":"What do they want you to do?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"}]},{"text":"Нужно, чтобы вы это сделали.","en":"It's necessary that you do that.","words":[{"g":"it is necessary"},null,{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"}]},{"text":"Важно, чтобы ты сказал правду.","en":"It's important that you tell the truth.","words":[{"g":"importantly"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},null]}]}